      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents repeatedly commend the veterinarians and support technicians for their compassionate bedside manner and thorough clinical attention. Reviewers emphasize that the staff explain medical conditions patiently, provide thoughtful treatment options, and maintain a comforting presence during difficult times."
