      "title": {
        "en": "Tender treatment for companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe how gently the veterinary team handles anxious dogs and cats during exams and medical procedures. Pet owners appreciate that animals are treated with patience and affection, allowing nervous pets to feel secure and cared for throughout their visits to the hospital."
      },
      "mentions": 26
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean and welcoming neighborhood clinic"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients often highlight the clean, well-maintained facility and organized reception area on Kingston Road. While visitors generally appreciate the tidy environment, one reviewer noted that strong cleaning scents can occasionally be noticeable in the waiting room during active sanitization."
      },
      "mentions": 20
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Kingston Road Animal Hospital accept new canine and feline patients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital welcomes new dogs and cats and offers online and telephone booking for general health checkups and vaccinations."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are after-hours veterinary emergencies handled?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital directs critical after-hours emergencies to regional emergency clinics such as the Toronto Veterinary Emergency Hospital."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pet owners receive detailed explanations regarding diagnoses and treatment?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers consistently note that veterinarians spend ample time answering pet parents' questions and outlining treatment plans clearly."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is parking available near the animal hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, client parking is available on surrounding residential streets and nearby metered spots along Kingston Road."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    }
